---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About Us | PanBloom.com"
	description="Learn about PanBloom.com, our mission, testing methodology, and team of mobile app and game reviewers."
>
	<div class="policy-page">
		<div class="container policy-container">
			<header class="policy-header">
				<span class="policy-eyebrow">About PanBloom</span>
				<h1 class="policy-title">The Haven for iOS and Android Enthusiasts</h1>
				<p class="policy-meta">Published since 2020 &bull; Independent Reviews &amp; Tech Guides</p>
			</header>

			<div class="policy-content">
				<section>
					<h2>Our Mission</h2>
					<p>
						Founded in 2020, <strong>PanBloom.com</strong> is dedicated to delivering candid, exhaustive, and rigorously tested reviews and tutorials for mobile games and applications across Apple iOS and Google Android platforms.
					</p>
					<p>
						In a digital landscape filled with sponsored content and pay-to-win hype, we stand for thorough hands-on testing, real battery performance measurements, transparent scoring, and zero tolerance for deceptive monetization.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>How We Test</h2>
					<p>
						Every app and game we review is downloaded and tested on real retail devices—from flagship iPhones and iPad Pros to mid-range and budget Android smartphones. We evaluate:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Usability &amp; Design:</strong> Interface ergonomics, touch responsiveness, accessibility, and visual polish.</li>
						<li><strong>Performance &amp; Battery:</strong> Frame rate consistency, thermal throttling, storage footprints, and battery drain per hour.</li>
						<li><strong>Value &amp; Monetization:</strong> Fairness of in-app purchases, intrusive ads, subscription pricing, and offline playability.</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>Editorial Independence &amp; AdSense Compliance</h2>
					<p>
						We believe in 100% editorial integrity. We do not accept payment in exchange for favorable reviews or inflated scores. For more details on how we separate editorial critique from affiliate revenue and advertising, please review our <a href="/editorial-policy">Editorial Policy</a>.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section id="authors">
					<h2>Our Authors &amp; Editorial Roster</h2>
					<p>
						PanBloom writers publish under dedicated, verified bylines with distinct specializations across mobile action gaming, productivity software, hardware battery preservation, and digital privacy.
					</p>
					<p>
						To view individual author credentials, biographies, and full published article indices, visit our dedicated <a href="/authors/">Our Authors Directory &rarr;</a>
					</p>
				</section>

				<section id="publisher">
					<h2>Corporate Publisher &amp; Legal Entity</h2>
					<p>
						<strong>PanBloom.com</strong> is owned, operated, and published by <strong>SATMAT DIGITAL LTD</strong>, a private company limited by shares registered in England and Wales.
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Company Name:</strong> SATMAT DIGITAL LTD</li>
						<li><strong>Company Type:</strong> Private company limited by shares</li>
						<li><strong>Situation of Registered Office:</strong> England and Wales</li>
						<li><strong>Registered Office Address:</strong> 308 St. Pauls Road, London, England N1 2LF</li>
						<li><strong>SIC Codes:</strong> 47910 (Retail sale via mail order houses or via Internet)</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>Contact the Team</h2>
					<p>
						Have a tip, game release suggestion, or app you'd like us to examine? Visit our <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a> or reach out to our editorial team at <code>editorial@panbloom.com</code>.
					</p>
				</section>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.policy-page {
		padding: 3.5rem 0 5rem;
	}

	.policy-container {
		max-width: 820px;
	}

	.policy-header {
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.policy-eyebrow {
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-blue-primary);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.policy-title {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		color: var(--color-text-dark);
		line-height: 1.2;
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
	}

	.policy-meta {
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.policy-content {
		color: #334155;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}

	.policy-content section {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.policy-content h2 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		color: var(--color-text-dark);
		margin: 1.75rem 0 0.75rem 0;
	}

	.policy-content p {
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.policy-content ul {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
	}

	.policy-content li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.policy-content a {
		color: var(--color-blue-primary);
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
</style>
